# GPU/CPU benchmark: liquid Al, Borovikov 2024 EAM/FS, n x n x n fcc cells (4 n^3 atoms).
#   GPU (Windows binary, OpenCL):  lmp -sf gpu -pk gpu 1 -in in.bench -var n 40
#   GPU (WSL CUDA build):          lmp -sf gpu -pk gpu 1 -in in.bench -var n 40
#   CPU reference:                 mpirun -np 8 lmp -in in.bench -var n 40
variable n     index 40
variable steps index 2000
units        metal
atom_style   atomic
boundary     p p p
lattice      fcc 4.016
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 4.016 4.016 4.016
region       box block 0 ${n} 0 ${n} 0 ${n}
region       box block 0 20 0 ${n} 0 ${n}
region       box block 0 20 0 20 0 ${n}
region       box block 0 20 0 20 0 20
create_box   1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (80.32 80.32 80.32)
  2 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid
create_atoms 1 box
Created 32000 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (80.32 80.32 80.32)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.002 seconds
mass         1 26.982
pair_style   eam/fs
pair_coeff   * * ../../potentials/NiAlNb_Borovikov2024/Ni-Al-Nb.eam.fs Al
timestep     0.002
velocity     all create 1200 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix          1 all npt temp 1200 1200 0.2 iso 0 0 2.0
thermo       500
run          500
